1
00:00:00,520 --> 00:00:10,004
PadCraft is a browser engineering workstation that designs a complete R P twenty forty macropad from one normalized configuration.

2
00:00:10,174 --> 00:00:21,739
The same model drives the circuit board, the switch plate, the enclosure source, every manufacturing layer and both firmware exports, entirely offline in one tab.

3
00:00:22,360 --> 00:00:25,970
Four showcase designs ship with the workstation.

4
00:00:26,140 --> 00:00:38,226
A twelve key studio controller, a six key sensor console with analog channels, a low profile pocket instrument, and a forty eight key stress test that maxes out the matrix.

5
00:00:38,395 --> 00:00:42,759
One click regenerates every artifact for the chosen design.

6
00:00:43,379 --> 00:00:49,429
Hover any pad to read its reference, net and drill size, and click to isolate that net.

7
00:00:49,599 --> 00:01:00,688
Dashed airwires mark the controller and peripheral connections still to route in KiCad, while the meter counts connected pad groups against what remains.

8
00:01:00,858 --> 00:01:09,628
Rows drive low and columns sense through a C O L two R O W matrix, with a diode per key and pins drawn from the legal G P I O pools.

9
00:01:10,248 --> 00:01:16,092
Rows, columns, pitch, switch footprint and peripherals all flow into the exports.

10
00:01:16,262 --> 00:01:29,505
The design rule audit checks pitch, enclosure, plate webs, the controller bay, drills, pin legality, keycodes, firmware polarity and copper clearance, and names every finding in the open.

11
00:01:30,125 --> 00:01:35,173
The output panel lists twenty five portable artifacts for one design.

12
00:01:35,343 --> 00:01:51,105
A KiCad eight board with resolved pad nets, seven Gerber layers, plated and non plated drill files, a watertight S T L plate, OpenSCAD source, K M K and Q M K firmware, a fingerprinted bill of materials and a sealed layout proof.

13
00:01:51,725 --> 00:01:58,410
The D F M lab benchmarks the shipped presets and four stress matrices against the real engine.

14
00:01:58,580 --> 00:02:07,385
Two charts plot the matrix scaling frontier and a manufacturing breakdown, and every row or marker loads that exact design.

15
00:02:07,555 --> 00:02:15,120
A proof brief seals the design under one S H A 256 digest, checked by twenty four in page self tests.

16
00:02:15,740 --> 00:02:22,865
Four hundred eighty nine Node tests pass with zero failures, re verified inside this recording run.

17
00:02:23,034 --> 00:02:28,115
PadCraft. One design, every layer, built for people who build hardware.
